<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH IPS 9MONTH GROSS PROFIT RISES.</title>
<headline>CZECH IPS 9MONTH GROSS PROFIT RISES.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary unconsolidated</p>
<p>results for nine-month period ending September 30, 1996: (in</p>
<p>millions of crowns)</p>
<p> Gross profit		 176.3	  vs	 151.6</p>
<p> Operating profit	   210.6	  vs	 192.3</p>
<p>Sales of own goods</p>
<p> and services	     3,215.8	  vs     2,659.5</p>
<p> Total assets	     9,597.0	  vs     5,575.6</p>
<p> Basic capital	    1,437.0	  vs     1,200.4</p>
<p>Note. Full company name is IPS Praha a.s.. The firm is a</p>
<p>Prague-based builder. Figures do not include results of IPS's</p>
<p>subsidiaries. IPS shares are listed on the main market of the</p>
<p>Prague Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
